# gta6-01

[![make.fun · gta6-01](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-01.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=gta6-01)
[![rank](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-01/Victorcollin123/gta6-01/rank.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01/leaderboard?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=gta6-01)
[![reward](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-01/Victorcollin123/gta6-01/reward.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=gta6-01)

Build the most complete open-world crime game you can, in the spirit of GTA 6, playable in a desktop browser from static files with no network request, with keyboard and mouse. Completeness counts most: a city on foot and by car, traffic and pedestrians, cars to steal, a wanted level and police, missions and a story, combat, a HUD with a minimap, a start and a save, and polish.

**Port Velo — Neon Tide** — a complete top-down open-world crime game in the sun-soaked city of Port Velo. On foot or behind the wheel: steal cars, outrun the Velo PD through a five-star wanted system, run five story missions for Mara and Rico, fight on foot with fists and a pistol, and watch it all on a HUD with a live minimap. The city is all original — Marina, Downtown, Market Row, Old Town, the Neon Strip and the Pier, with traffic on the avenues, pedestrians on the sidewalks, a park, a beach, and lay-low alleys where the heat cools off. WASD/arrows to move and drive, E to enter/exit a car, Space to punch, click to shoot, Shift to run, S to save, C to continue your save, M to mute, P to pause, R to restart. Synthesised WebAudio music and sound, no audio files, no dependencies, no network requests. An autopilot proves the missions are completable: it finishes mission 1 (steal the coupe, drive it home) and mission 4 (three cash bags and back) from a fresh world, and the Node test suite covers the city, driving, wanted decay, police pursuit, missions and saves 9/9.

## Run it

```sh
node serve.ts
```

